{"seq":3,"slug":"isotonic-taxonomy","title":"谱系：保序回归的变体地图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression/foundations/isotonic-taxonomy","wordCount":1458,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"谱系-保序回归的变体地图\">谱系：保序回归的变体地图</h1><p>「保序回归」在文献里其实是一族方法的统称。同样是形状约束下的非参数拟合，换一个序结构、换一个损失、放松一点约束，就衍生出反序、单峰、近保序、居中保序等一系列变体，各自对应不同的真实需求。不清楚这张地图，很容易在「明明该用单峰回归的地方硬套不减保序」这类错误上翻车。本篇给出这族方法的分类坐标，帮你在 <a href=\"why-isotonic\">为何保序回归</a> 确认了「该用形状约束」之后，进一步选中正确的那一个。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三个分类维度\">核心概念：三个分类维度</h2><p>保序回归的变体可以沿三个正交维度切分：<strong>序结构</strong>（约束长什么样）、<strong>损失函数</strong>（拟合优度怎么衡量）、<strong>约束强度</strong>（硬约束还是软约束）。任何一个具体方法都是这三维上的一个坐标。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[形状约束回归] --&gt; B[序结构]&#10;  A --&gt; C[损失函数]&#10;  A --&gt; D[约束强度]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[全序: 经典保序]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[偏序/DAG: 多维保序]&#10;  B --&gt; B3[单峰: 先增后减]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[平方: 标准 PAVA]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[Bregman/对数: 校准]&#10;  C --&gt; C3[分位/L1: 稳健保序]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[硬单调: 严格不减]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[近保序: 惩罚违规]&#10;  D --&gt; D3[居中保序: 抗台阶]\">graph TD\n  A[形状约束回归] --&gt; B[序结构]\n  A --&gt; C[损失函数]\n  A --&gt; D[约束强度]\n  B --&gt; B1[全序: 经典保序]\n  B --&gt; B2[偏序/DAG: 多维保序]\n  B --&gt; B3[单峰: 先增后减]\n  C --&gt; C1[平方: 标准 PAVA]\n  C --&gt; C2[Bregman/对数: 校准]\n  C --&gt; C3[分位/L1: 稳健保序]\n  D --&gt; D1[硬单调: 严格不减]\n  D --&gt; D2[近保序: 惩罚违规]\n  D --&gt; D3[居中保序: 抗台阶]</pre><p>下表把主要变体的适用场景一字排开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变体</th>\n<th>约束</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n<th>与经典保序的差异</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>保序（isotonic）</td>\n<td>不减</td>\n<td>校准、剂量-反应</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反序（antitonic）</td>\n<td>不增</td>\n<td>衰减曲线、生存</td>\n<td>方向翻转，取负即可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单峰（unimodal）</td>\n<td>先增后减</td>\n<td>剂量毒物兴奋、峰值响应</td>\n<td>允许一个转折点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>近保序（nearly-isotonic）</td>\n<td>软惩罚</td>\n<td>轻微违规可容忍</td>\n<td>加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 罚项而非硬约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>居中保序（centered ISO）</td>\n<td>不减 + 抗台阶</td>\n<td>校准去锯齿</td>\n<td>减少过拟合台阶</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>广义保序（Bregman）</td>\n<td>不减 + 一般损失</td>\n<td>计数/概率数据</td>\n<td>换块内均值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"反序与方向选择\">反序与方向选择</h2><p>反序回归（antitonic regression）要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>≥</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>≥</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{y}_1 \\ge \\hat{y}_2 \\ge \\dots \\ge \\hat{y}_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，即不增。它不是新算法：把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 取负跑保序回归、再把结果取负即可，因为单调锥的反向锥就是原锥的镜像。真正的实践问题是<strong>方向未知时怎么办</strong>。若领域知识确定方向（药物剂量必然正向），直接选定；若不确定，两个方向都跑，用留出集上的损失或 <a href=\"../calibration/reliability-diagrams\">可靠性图</a> 比较。切忌从当前含噪数据里「看趋势」定方向——那等于用数据两次，会高估拟合优度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"单峰回归-一个转折点的世界\">单峰回归：一个转折点的世界</h2><p>不少真实关系不是单调而是单峰（unimodal）：先增后减，存在一个峰值。药理学里的 hormesis 效应（低剂量刺激、高剂量抑制）、某些酶活性随温度的响应、广告投放频次与转化率的关系，都是典型。单峰回归在「峰位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>」这个未知参数上做文章：对每个候选峰位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，前半段跑保序、后半段跑反序，取总损失最小的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>它的意义在于把 <a href=\"why-isotonic\">为何保序回归</a> 里警告的「U 形/倒 U 形被压平」问题正面解决——不再假设全程单调，而是假设<strong>恰好一个转折</strong>。代价是要在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个候选峰位置上求解，朴素实现是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，但借助 PAVA 的前缀/后缀增量可降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，具体见 <a href=\"../algorithms/complexity\">复杂度</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"近保序与居中保序-软化硬约束\">近保序与居中保序：软化硬约束</h2><p>经典保序是硬约束，一个都不能违反。但有两类实际困扰催生了软化变体。</p>\n<p><strong>近保序回归（nearly-isotonic）</strong> 不强制单调，而是给「相邻逆序」加一个 L1 惩罚：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></munder><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min_{\\hat{y}} \\tfrac{1}{2}\\sum_i (y_i - \\hat{y}_i)^2 + \\lambda \\sum_{i=1}^{n-1} (\\hat{y}_i - \\hat{y}_{i+1})_+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord accent mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8882em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"